                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "abda9682-d6ce-3923-8adf-dcbec9dd6846",
                        "entry_id": "648ed0de-e66e-360a-be75-56686729e677",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who is responsible for the maintenance of equipment belonging to a shipping company, railroad, trucking company, or colliery."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccb602e4-6a52-40a2-8f9e-71ca935528d6",
                                "sense_id": "abda9682-d6ce-3923-8adf-dcbec9dd6846",
                                "text": "As gearman I have to see that the brakes are in perfect order; cars are in running order on 23d Street line at present."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e99f9e1-b4b5-4a5e-8f22-aee8b2910cc8",
                                "sense_id": "abda9682-d6ce-3923-8adf-dcbec9dd6846",
                                "text": "In this case the gearman's job consists simply in keeping the slime off the drum with bathbrick and attending to the oiling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "327635da-206e-487f-81b8-63cd244a92e0",
                                "sense_id": "abda9682-d6ce-3923-8adf-dcbec9dd6846",
                                "text": "Before a job is begun the nature of the cargo and the gear that will be required is determined; required gear is taken out of stock in the gear locker room by the gearman. It is then loaded on the gear trucks and driven to the pier […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63bbb309-92f7-47c3-951f-0f7d9d4c0645",
                                "sense_id": "abda9682-d6ce-3923-8adf-dcbec9dd6846",
                                "text": "It is therefore difficult to know where the gearmen's loyalty ends and their employer's dependence begins. Gearmen have an equally complicated relationship with fellow longshoremen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c29cdb35-c72c-40af-bd28-f80d2cadf106",
                                "sense_id": "abda9682-d6ce-3923-8adf-dcbec9dd6846",
                                "text": "Dreamy was working him on the gear with the gearman during the day, checking clusters, replacing burned out bulbs, repairing tents, changing runners, replacing guys, trimming derricks."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
